<Base title="About">
  <h1 class="display text-5xl">About</h1>
  <div class="prose mt-10">
    <p class="lead">I’m an AI engineer in Kathmandu. I work on natural language processing for text and speech, and on computer vision, with a background in app development and backend systems.</p>
    <blockquote><p>Explorer of knowledge, not prisoner of perfection.</p></blockquote>
    <h2>What I do</h2>
    <p>I research, build and deploy AI systems, from training custom models to fine-tuning existing ones for real use. I design the infrastructure those models run on, and I ship them in Flutter apps.</p>
    <p>Outside work I care about open source, graphic design and music production.</p>
    <h2>How I got here</h2>
    <p>I started with Python in high school, for cybersecurity, solving rooms on TryHackMe at night. During the pandemic I picked up HTML, CSS, JavaScript, PHP and C/C++ and built small projects. Then I found machine learning and never really left.</p>
    <p>I studied Computer Engineering at Kantipur Engineering College. I now work as an AI engineer at EkGhanti Services.</p>
    <h2>Community</h2>
    <p>I’m the Ed-Tech Lead for Google Developer Groups Kathmandu and the Notion Campus Leader at Kantipur Engineering College.</p>
    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>If you want to talk about AI, apps or music, email me at <a href="mailto:gaurovgiri@gmail.com">gaurovgiri@gmail.com</a>, or just ask the avatar on the <a href="/">home page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
